{"title":"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Elimination)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Elimination)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d95c1790482cb4dcf62a2ef5ec3340a39123ac.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{2^{2014}+2^{2012}}{2^{2014}-2^{2012}}?\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/8/d08231e3f5055cbc919e39efc7d6ff5867bf7460.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -1\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 1\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{5}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2013\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 2^{4024}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"428\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/c/23c4d76bfa7879ef51309bb1bd05b99acee3e81f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^{2014}+2^{2012}}{2^{2014}-2^{2012}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"97\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>We can factor a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/0/e806c8d89f7fca19fe8db63a773c76e5a11236c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${2^{2012}}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> out of the numerator and denominator to obtain\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/d/31d9f7158c67276b3e5531634cb46d8c62dcfc32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2^{2012}*(2^2+1)}{2^{2012}*(2^2-1)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"121\" height=\"45\" />\n</p><p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/0/e806c8d89f7fca19fe8db63a773c76e5a11236c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${2^{2012}}$\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> cancels, so we get \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/a/5da065d5d6b5c2f612da3682c103e189ab0d8115.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{(2^2+1)}{(2^2-1)}=\\frac{5}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"101\" height=\"43\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/e/c2ea1f26e83764cfc076dcd8f8cdbb81186df558.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=2^{2012}.\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" /> Then the given expression is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/8/8f87e898da4d0e6a1d49fcb6bff19c50e50990dc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{4x+x}{4x-x}=\\frac{5x}{3x}=\\boxed{\\frac{5}{3}\\textbf{(C)}}.\\]\" width=\"182\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>~sugar_rush\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Elimination.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Elimination)\">Solution 3 (Elimination)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Elimination)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> cannot be true, because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/1/b5187c90264d42c06bfcc2617b8c84ab7ea8cc54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2014}+2^{2012}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" /> is clearly larger than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/8/858496bce2bac1759c02d54a9062cc143baed91e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2014}-2^{2012}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />. We can apply our same logic to choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and eliminate it as well. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/a/2fa725c98dfe19f98809033755b801810bc298aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2013$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/6/4d63a88f8f39b7fe41fb92b817f4051338a3732a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{4024}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"17\" /> are all whole numbers, but <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/1/b5187c90264d42c06bfcc2617b8c84ab7ea8cc54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2014}+2^{2012}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" /> is not a multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/8/858496bce2bac1759c02d54a9062cc143baed91e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2014}-2^{2012}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />, so we can eliminate choices <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> too. This leaves us with choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" /> as our final answer.\n</p><p>~dbnl\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2vf843cvVzo?t=545\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2vf843cvVzo?t=545</a> (solution for #4 starts at 9:05)\n</p><p>~sugar_rush\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A\">2013 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href